  "kind": "picture",
  "mood": "optical art — hard-edged stripes, checks or dot grids printed on a sheet that bulges, ripples or folds, so a flat two- or three-colour print seems to move; the pattern tapers to hairlines and bare paper where the copy sits. Bold, hypnotic, 1960s-modern. Good for music and club nights, design and fashion events, exhibitions, tech launches, anything that should vibrate.",
